Bundled work
------------

The image contains XMRig (https://github.com/xmrig/xmrig), licensed under the
GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

XMRig has been MODIFIED for this image. The modification, applied in the builder
stage of the Dockerfile, is:

    src/donate.h — kDefaultDonateLevel and kMinimumDonateLevel are both changed
    from 1 to 0, disabling the miner's built-in donation.

No other source file is altered.

Because the image conveys a modified GPL-3.0 work in object form, the image as a
whole is conveyed under the terms of the GPL-3.0-or-later.

Corresponding source
--------------------

The complete corresponding source is:

  * upstream XMRig at the tag recorded in the image's
    org.opencontainers.image.version label, from
    https://github.com/xmrig/xmrig ; plus
  * the modification above, which is the build recipe in this repository's
    Dockerfile.

Both travel inside the image itself, under /usr/share/licenses/xmrig/ :

    LICENSE    — upstream XMRig GPL-3.0 licence text
    donate.h   — the modified file, as compiled
    NOTICE     — this file

